{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o010b","title":"孟达率众降魏","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o010b-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"孟达率众降魏","evidence":["wendi-e-o010b-q"]},{"id":"mingdi-e-p007a-account","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"延康元年，孟达率四千余家归魏曹丕遣人察其才。","evidence":["mingdi-e-p007a-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-aba21ad9f39213913ca4","label":"正文","text":"延康元年孟达率众降文帝甚器爱之","evidence":["chengguo-q-aeacfcb43c4e717c3e8a"]},{"id":"liuliao-a-b9639b654cb2042dabf2","label":"正文","text":"达惧罪率所领降魏","evidence":["liuliao-q-6972e29d3070cf1efaa2"]},{"id":"duzhou-a-bdde73ec189192bdb830","label":"正文","text":"郤揖随孟达降魏","evidence":["duzhou-q-6ebfbc56aa670fefde09"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0071","role":"归降","evidence":["wendi-e-o010b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"遣察","evidence":["mingdi-e-p007a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0070","role":"与达忿争不和、寻夺达鼓吹","evidence":["liuliao-q-6972e29d3070cf1efaa2"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"所表辞者","evidence":["liuliao-q-6972e29d3070cf1efaa2"]},{"person":"duzhou-p0074","role":"为将军孟达营都督，随孟达降魏，为中书令史","evidence":["duzhou-q-6ebfbc56aa670fefde09"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年七月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年七月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o010b-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o010b-q","source_order":[2,68,"O010b"],"order":497}],"persons":[{"id":"duzhou-p0074","name":"郤揖","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0070","name":"刘封","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0071","name":"孟达","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-aeacfcb43c4e717c3e8a","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-f8a55e273c5a6f3c4809","layer":"original","quote":"延康元年，蜀将孟达率众降。达有容止才观〖1〗，文帝甚器爱之","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29},{"id":"duzhou-q-6ebfbc56aa670fefde09","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-8c61a7d2840a5e8b787b","layer":"original","quote":"揖为将军孟达营都督〖2〗，随达降魏，为中书令史","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":364,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":49,"end":72},{"id":"liuliao-q-6972e29d3070cf1efaa2","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-e0170f6f55ee0c459ef7","layer":"original","quote":"又封与达忿争不和，封寻夺达鼓吹〖8〗。达既惧罪，又忿恚封，遂表辞先主，率所领降魏","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":95},{"id":"mingdi-e-p007a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5bf81d9dfe407ed70c63","layer":"pei","quote":"达以延康元年率部曲四千余家，归魏。文帝时初即王位，既宿知有达，闻其来，甚悦。令贵臣有识察者往观之，还曰‘将帅之才也’，或曰‘卿相之器也’；王益钦达","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-680a01f5d7c24c678bdc","start":7,"end":80},{"id":"wendi-e-o010b-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-7a2dbfc0b022363adb0c","layer":"original","quote":"蜀将孟达率众降〖8〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":7,"end":18},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
